  "text": "\r\n\t\t Government | Epping, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Links   \t\t\t \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Employment  \t\t\t \n     How Do I...?   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Budget Committee \r\n\t\t\t Cemetery Trustees \r\n\t\t\t Conservation Commission \r\n\t\t\t\t Contact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t Epping Conservation Commission Website \r\n\t\t\t Epping Community Power \r\n\t\t\t Planning Board / Code Enforcement \r\n\t\t\t\t Applications & Regulations \r\n\t\t\t\t Technical Review Committee \r\n\t\t\t\t Sign Ordinance \r\n\t\t\t\t Excavation Regulations \r\n\t\t\t\t Groundwater Protection District Map \r\n\t\t\t Recreation Commission \r\n\t\t\t\t Job Opportunities \r\n\t\t\t\t Epping Parks & Recreation Department Website \r\n\t\t\t Select Board \r\n\t\t\t\t Home Occupation Permit (PDF) \r\n\t\t\t\t Large Assembly Permit (PDF) \r\n\t\t\t\t Meeting Videos (ETV) \r\n\t\t\t\t Peddler/Vendors Permit (PDF) \r\n\t\t\t\t Raffle Permit (PDF) \r\n\t\t\t\t Tax Rate \r\n\t\t\t\t 2023 Town Report \r\n\t\t\t\t 2024 Town Report \r\n\t\t\t\t 2025 Town Report \r\n\t\t\t Supervisors of the Checklist \r\n\t\t\t Trustees of the Trust Fund \r\n\t\t\t Water & Sewer Commission \r\n\t\t\t\t Water & Sewer Department \r\n\t\t\t Zoning Board of Adjustment \r\n\t\t\t\t Zoning Map (PDF) \r\n\t\t\t\t Zoning Ordinance (PDF) \r\nHome \nGovernment \r\nGovernment\t\t \r\n9 \n1 \n1 \n2 \t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Budget Committee \r\nThe Municipal Budget Committee is a committee of nine elected individuals, plus a representative from the Board of Selectman and the School Board from the community. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Cemetery Trustees \r\nOversees the care, maintenance, and preservation of Epping’s cemeteries and burial grounds.\n\t\t\t\t\t Conservation Commission \r\nWorks to protect Epping’s natural resources, manage conservation lands, and engage the community in environmental stewardship.\n\t\t\t\t\t Epping Community Power \r\nManages Epping’s participation in the Community Power Coalition of NH, offering residents competitive energy supply options.\n\t\t\t\t\t Planning Board / Code Enforcement \r\nOversees land use, development, and zoning in Epping while ensuring compliance with town codes and regulations.\n\t\t\t\t\t Recreation Commission \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Select Board \r\nServes as Epping’s executive governing board, overseeing town policy, finances, appointments, and licensing decisions.\n\t\t\t\t\t Supervisors of the Checklist \r\nManages and updates Epping’s voter registration checklist to ensure accurate and up-to-date voting records.\n\t\t\t\t\t Trustees of the Trust Fund \r\nOversees and manages Epping’s trust funds to support community needs and long-term financial stewardship.\n\t\t\t\t\t Water & Sewer Commission \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Zoning Board of Adjustment \r\nHandles requests for zoning variances and appeals, ensuring fair application of Epping’s zoning ordinances.\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \n\t\t\t Town Updates \r\n\t\t\t Boards & Commissions \n\t\t\t Departments \n\t\t\t Online Services \n\t\t\t Forms & Documents \nContact Us \r\nTown of Epping \r\n157 Main Street \r\nEpping, NH 03042 \r\nPhone:  603-679-5441 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Epping Community Theater \n         Conservation Commission \n         Epping Library \n         Parks and Rec \n         Epping Schools \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Contact Us \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
